<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<title>AI智能助手</title>


<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:
"Microsoft YaHei",
Arial;
}


body{

height:100vh;

background:
radial-gradient(
circle at top,
#dcd6ff,
transparent 35%
),
linear-gradient(
180deg,
#ffffff,
#f7f4ff
);

}


/*导航*/

.nav{

height:80px;

display:flex;

align-items:center;

justify-content:space-between;

padding:0 80px;

}



.logo{

font-size:28px;

font-weight:bold;

background:
linear-gradient(
90deg,
#685cff,
#c43cff
);

color:transparent;

-webkit-background-clip:text;

}



.nav button{

border:none;

background:#111;

color:white;

padding:12px 25px;

border-radius:30px;

}



/*主体*/

.main{

height:calc(100vh - 80px);

display:flex;

flex-direction:column;

align-items:center;

text-align:center;

padding-top:30px;

}



.tag{

background:#eee8ff;

color:#7055ff;

padding:8px 20px;

border-radius:30px;

}



h1{

font-size:70px;

margin-top:25px;

}


.gradient{

background:
linear-gradient(
90deg,
#685cff,
#d13cff
);

-webkit-background-clip:text;

color:transparent;

}



.desc{

font-size:20px;

color:#666;

margin-top:25px;

}



.btn{

margin-top:35px;

padding:16px 45px;

border-radius:40px;

border:none;

font-size:18px;

color:white;

background:
linear-gradient(
90deg,
#675bff,
#c832ff
);

}



/*AI窗口*/


.ai{

margin-top:50px;

width:850px;

height:260px;

background:white;

border-radius:30px;

box-shadow:
0 20px 60px
rgba(0,0,0,.12);

padding:30px;


}


.title{

text-align:left;

color:#999;

}



.chat{

margin-top:30px;

background:#f7f5ff;

height:120px;

border-radius:20px;

display:flex;

align-items:center;

justify-content:center;

font-size:22px;

color:#555;

}



/*功能*/

.features{

display:flex;

gap:20px;

margin-top:25px;

}



.card{

background:white;

padding:18px 40px;

border-radius:20px;

box-shadow:
0 10px 30px
rgba(0,0,0,.06);

}



</style>


</head>



<body>


<div class="nav">


<div class="logo">

AI Nova

</div>


<div>

产品介绍

&nbsp;&nbsp;

解决方案

&nbsp;&nbsp;

联系我们

</div>



<button>

登录

</button>


</div>





<div class="main">


<div class="tag">

✨ 下一代 AI 智能助手

</div>



<h1>

让 AI

<span class="gradient">

创造更多可能

</span>

</h1>



<div class="desc">

帮助企业快速完成知识问答、
内容生成和智能分析

</div>



<button class="btn">

立即体验

</button>





<div class="ai">


<div class="title">

AI Assistant

</div>



<div class="chat">

你好，我可以帮助你解决问题

</div>



<div class="features">


<div class="card">

💬 智能问答

</div>


<div class="card">

✍️ AI写作

</div>


<div class="card">

📊 数据分析

</div>


</div>



</div>



</div>


</body>

</html>
